{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter[[cite:obs-3530ece9e05be481c876c9bd3a20caab350b1507 \"Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter.\"]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-9a590870dcfb4ebc1b2c4dd55657f12f8585a296 \"Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added statements about the membership fee and the annual amount paid by members, each followed by exact citations from the charter and annex sources as requested."}